Dr. Foushee was confronted by Rand Paul or
maybe Rand Paul was confronted by Dr. Fauci.

00:05:31.889 --> 00:05:33.089
I don't know exactly.

00:05:33.089 --> 00:05:35.430
We'll have to look at the video and decide
for ourselves.

00:05:35.430 --> 00:06:30.559
That'll be after this short break and much

00:06:30.559 --> 00:06:39.680
more upcoming.

